{
  "account": "plur",
  "background": { "color": "#0A0A0A" },
  "slides": [
    {
      "type": "cover",
      "main": "The Night Fabric Died.",
      "sub": "And the world refused to stay silent."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "1999. London.",
        "Beneath a former meat market.",
        "Soot-stained stone ceilings.",
        "A club was born."
      ],
      "sub": "Farringdon, EC1"
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "The floor vibrated.",
        "400 transducers.",
        "Sound entered the body directly.",
        "Europe's first Bodysonic floor."
      ],
      "sub": "DJ Mag No.1 — 2007, 2008"
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "26 June 2016.",
        "A young man died.",
        "6 August — another. Eighteen years old."
      ],
      "sub": "August: Fabric suspended. 7 September: licence revoked."
    },
    {
      "type": "quote",
      "quote": [
        "This club has a drug culture.",
        "We cannot manage it."
      ],
      "note": "Islington Council — the reason given for closure, September 2016"
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "No one stayed quiet.",
        "DJs worldwide spoke out.",
        "£100,000 raised in four days.",
        "£330,000 in total.",
        "Sadiq Khan said:",
        "\"This decision is wrong.\""
      ],
      "sub": "The industry answered."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "November 2016.",
        "Fabric and the council reached a deal.",
        "Forty new conditions.",
        "Stricter security. ID scanning.",
        "6 January 2017 —",
        "the doors opened again."
      ],
      "sub": "Seventeen years of memory survived."
    },
    {
      "type": "cta",
      "text": [
        "A club is not a playground.",
        "It is the root of culture.",
        "You only understand what was there",
        "when you almost lose it."
      ],
      "strobe": "6 January 2017",
      "cta": "Save this. You'll want to read it again."
    }
  ]
}
